Subject: [PATCH 1/8] m02: move inline stage directions out of voiced lines

Directions inside spoken person-chat lines become #delivery: notes; Sister
Doyle's first look round becomes a Narrator line; Ghost's video-call lines
(no delivery note sent) just lose the cue. Ink recompiled.
