-{"inkVersion":21,"root":[[["done",{"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"start":["ev",{"VAR?":"gary_defensive"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"defensive_return"},{"->":"start.4"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"gave_keycard"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"returning"},{"->":"start.10"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"met_gary"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"returning"},{"->":"start.16"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"first_meeting"},null],"first_meeting":[["^Narrator: Two dead terminals, a cold mug with a skin on it, and a printed stack of his own emails squared up beside the keyboard.","\n","^Gary Whitlock: *not turning round* If you're head office, the answer's still no. I can't \"just restore from backup\". The backup's the bit they encrypted.","\n","^Gary Whitlock: If you're the police, I've told your mate everything twice.","\n","^Gary Whitlock: And if you're the board, I've put it all in writing. Seven times.","\n","ev","str","^Seven times. I know.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^I'm the incident responder. Talk me through what you've got.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^You're the administrator. This is your estate. How did it get this bad?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"met_gary","re":true},"ev",{"VAR?":"gary_influence"},15,"+",{"VAR=":"gary_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#",{"->":"open_solidarity"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"met_gary","re":true},"ev",{"VAR?":"gary_influence"},8,"+",{"VAR=":"gary_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#",{"->":"open_professional"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"met_gary","re":true},"ev",{"VAR?":"gary_influence"},18,"-",{"VAR=":"gary_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_decreased","/#",{"->":"open_blame"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"open_solidarity":[["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"topic_warnings","re":true},"ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"gary_trusts_player","re":true},"^Gary Whitlock: You know.","\n","^Narrator: He turns round properly for the first time.","\n","^Gary Whitlock: Nobody's read them. Kim read the first one. Finance read the one with the number in it.","\n","^Gary Whitlock: After that it was \"noted\", and \"noted\", and \"noted\".","\n","^Gary Whitlock: By the end I was writing them for the archive. So one day somebody could find them and see I'd said it.","\n","^Gary Whitlock: Bit pathetic when you say it out loud.","\n","ev","str","^It's a paper trail. Tonight it's the most useful thing in this building.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Six months ignored, and you're still here at four in the morning fixing it.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},"ev","str","^Then this time somebody actions it. What do you need from me?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^Narrator: Something goes out of his shoulders.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"gary_influence"},12,"+",{"VAR=":"gary_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Gary Whitlock: Yeah.","\n","^Gary Whitlock: Right. What do you need?","\n",{"->":"the_ask"},null],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"gary_influence"},10,"+",{"VAR=":"gary_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Gary Whitlock: Well, where else am I going to be? There's people upstairs on generators.","\n","^Gary Whitlock: Turns out you can be furious and useful. Who knew.","\n",{"->":"the_ask"},null],"c-2":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"gary_influence"},8,"+",{"VAR=":"gary_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Gary Whitlock: What I need is a time machine and eighty-five grand in May.","\n","^Gary Whitlock: Failing that, ask me your questions.","\n",{"->":"the_ask"},null]}],null],"open_professional":[["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"topic_vulnerability","re":true},"^Gary Whitlock: *swivelling round* Finally. Someone who wants the technical version.","\n","^Gary Whitlock: Backup server. ProFTPD -- the poisoned one, one point three point three c.","\n","^Gary Whitlock: Somebody trojaned the actual source release back in 2010 and it shipped with a backdoor built in. It's been public and patchable since. Fourteen years.","\n","^Gary Whitlock: Whoever did this didn't have to be clever. They had to be awake and have a scanner.","\n","^Gary Whitlock: That box holds every clinical backup we own. That's the whole disaster in one sentence, and I emailed that sentence in May.","\n","ev","str","^Fourteen years unpatched on the backup box. Somebody chose not to fund that.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Then we go in the same way they did. Show me the route.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"gary_influence"},12,"+",{"VAR=":"gary_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"topic_warnings","re":true},"ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"gary_trusts_player","re":true},"^Gary Whitlock: Say that in front of the board and I'll buy you a pint.","\n",{"->":"the_ask"},null],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"gary_influence"},8,"+",{"VAR=":"gary_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Gary Whitlock: Fight fire with fire. Yeah. Yeah, that's clever, actually.","\n","^Gary Whitlock: The exploit gets you a shell. From there it's their staging, their logs, their everything.","\n",{"->":"the_ask"},null]}],null],"open_blame":[["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"gary_defensive","re":true},"^Gary Whitlock: *very still* My estate.","\n","^Gary Whitlock: I costed the fix in May. Eighty-five thousand pounds. I sent it seven times.","\n","^Gary Whitlock: I was told to stop escalating it outside the department, in writing, by the Chief Technology Officer, and I have that email in my hand right now.","\n","^Gary Whitlock: Then they signed off three point two million on a scanner.","\n","^Narrator: He puts the keycard down in front of you, hard enough that it skids.","\n","#","^complete_task:talk_to_gary","/#","#","^give_item:keycard:server_room_keycard","/#","^Gary Whitlock: Server room. Take it. That's what you came for.","\n","#","^unlock_task:learn_about_scapegoating","/#","^Gary Whitlock: And when the write-up says the administrator failed to maintain his estate, you'll have known. And said nothing. Same as the rest of them.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"gave_keycard","re":true},"ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"cover_burned","re":true},"ev","str","^Gary, I--","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Take the card back. Let's start again.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^Gary Whitlock: Don't.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"defensive_hub"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"gary_influence"},5,"+",{"VAR=":"gary_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Gary Whitlock: You keep it. I'm not doing this twice.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"defensive_hub"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"the_ask":[["ev","str","^I need into the server room. What's it going to take?","/str",{"VAR?":"gave_keycard"},"!","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":5},"ev","str","^Tell me about the warnings.","/str",{"VAR?":"topic_warnings"},"!","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":5},"ev","str","^Walk me through the vulnerability.","/str",{"VAR?":"topic_vulnerability"},"!","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":5},"ev","str","^Nothing yet. I'll come back.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"keycard_request"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"discuss_warnings"},null],"c-2":["\n",{"->":"discuss_vulnerability"},null],"c-3":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"gary_trusts_player"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Gary Whitlock: Go on. I'll be here. Obviously.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Gary Whitlock: Course you will. Everybody comes back when they want something.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],"nop","\n","#","^exit_conversation","/#",{"->":"gary_waiting"},null]}],null],"keycard_request":["^Narrator: He pulls a lanyard out from under his collar.",