'd you get that.","\n","ev","str","^Your filing cabinet. It's a good lock. Not a great one.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Does it matter? It exists, and it's in my hands now.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^Gary Whitlock: *almost laughs* No. It isn't.","\n",{"->":"email_reaction"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"email_reaction"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"email_reaction":[["^Gary Whitlock: Know what I've been doing tonight, between restores? Printing those. All seven.","\n","#","^unlock_task:learn_about_scapegoating","/#","^Gary Whitlock: I've been working out how long it takes a hospital board to decide it was one man's fault. About a day and a half.","\n","^Gary Whitlock: So I thought: at least when they come for me, it'll be on paper.","\n","^Gary Whitlock: And now you've walked in with one of them in your hand.","\n","ev","str","^All seven go in the SAFETYNET record. You won't carry this alone.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^I need the same thing your board needed and ignored. Access.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","#","^complete_task:learn_about_scapegoating","/#","#","^set_global:gary_protected:true","/#","^Narrator: He has to look away for a second.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"gary_influence"},15,"+",{"VAR=":"gary_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Gary Whitlock: Right.","\n","^Gary Whitlock: Right, well. Let's get you what you need, quick, before I make a show of myself.","\n",{"->":"leverage_payoff"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"gary_influence"},5,"+",{"VAR=":"gary_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Gary Whitlock: Fair enough. At least you're honest about it.","\n",{"->":"leverage_payoff"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"leverage_payoff":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"topic_passwords","re":true},"ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"cover_burned","re":true},"#","^complete_task:talk_to_gary","/#","#","^complete_task:obtain_password_hints","/#","ev",{"VAR?":"gave_keyc