-{"inkVersion":21,"root":[[["done",{"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"start":["ev",{"VAR?":"gave_key"},"!","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"first_meeting"},{"->":"start.5"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"cover_burned"},{"VAR?":"cover_restored"},"!","&&","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"cover_burned_entry"},{"->":"start.14"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"returning"},null],"first_meeting":[["ev",{"VAR?":"cover_burned"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"met_after_burn","re":true},"^Narrator: Bernie Nwosu is holding a phone handset away from her ear. She puts it down as you reach the desk.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Before you say anything. Security control have just rung me about a consultant who apparently doesn't exist.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: I'm guessing that's you. I want your version first.","\n",{"->":"the_struck_entry"},{"->":".^.^.^.4"},null]}],"nop","\n","^Narrator: Ten past four in the morning. Every screen behind the desk is black, and the lights run amber off the generators.","\n","^Narrator: Bernie Nwosu is holding the front of this hospital together with a clipboard, a landline and a dying biro.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: *rattling it off* If it's the computers, I know. If it's your appointment, it's cancelled.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: If it's the vending machine, that's been broken since March. And if you're press, there's a car park you can stand in.","\n","ev","str","^I'm the security consultant Dr. Kim called in. It's about the ransomware.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^I need Dr. Kim. Where is she?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^You've been on this desk since it started, haven't you?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"bernie_influence"},1,"+",{"VAR=":"bernie_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#",{"->":"route_consultant"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"route_demand"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"bernie_influence"},2,"+",{"VAR=":"bernie_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#",{"->":"route_human"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"route_consultant":[["^Bernie Nwosu: Say that again.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: I've had the police, two journalists, and a man from head office asking if it's been \"logged in the incident system\".","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Which is encrypted. Along with the incident.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: The cardiac ward's monitoring is down. Nobody's watching those hearts but us.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: So. Security consultant. Convince me.","\n","ev","str","^Dr. Kim called for emergency incident response at one this morning. Check your log.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^I don't need to convince you. Just point me at IT.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^I can't. Ring her extension and ask her yourself.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"was_honest","re":true},"ev",{"VAR?":"bernie_influence"},2,"+",{"VAR=":"bernie_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Bernie Nwosu: Oh, I will.","\n",{"->":"the_struck_entry"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"bernie_influence"},1,"-",{"VAR=":"bernie_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_decreased","/#","^Bernie Nwosu: Everyone who's ever nicked something from this hospital walked in talking like that.","\n",{"->":"the_struck_entry"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"was_honest","re":true},"^Narrator: She dials four digits and waits. Somewhere up on the admin corridor, a phone rings out.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"bernie_influence"},3,"+",{"VAR=":"bernie_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Bernie Nwosu: Not answering. She hasn't answered since three.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: But you told me to ring, which is more than the journalists did.","\n",{"->":"the_struck_entry"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"route_demand":[["^Bernie Nwosu: And you are?","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Forty-seven people upstairs on generators, and I've no way of checking who anybody is tonight.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: So \"I need Dr. Kim\" isn't a sentence. It's the start of one.","\n","ev","str","^Emergency security consultant. She called me in at one this morning.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Every minute you spend on this, those generators are burning.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"was_honest","re":true},"ev",{"VAR?":"bernie_influence"},2,"+",{"VAR=":"bernie_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Bernie Nwosu: Right. That I can work with.","\n",{"->":"the_struck_entry"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"bernie_influence"},2,"-",{"VAR=":"bernie_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_decreased","/#","^Bernie Nwosu: *very evenly* I've counted every one of those minutes tonight. Don't you dare use them on me.","\n","^Narrator: She holds your eye a second too long, then reaches for the paper log anyway.","\n",{"->":"the_struck_entry"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"route_human":[["^Bernie Nwosu: Two forty-seven. I was on my break. The whole wall of screens went at once, like somebody threw a switch.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Eleven years I've done this desk. Fires, floods, the roof coming in on Paediatrics.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Never had the building just... stop knowing who anybody was.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Anyway. You're not a patient and you're not press. What are you?","\n","ev","str","^Security consultant. Dr. Kim called me in.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^I'm the person who's going to get your screens back.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"was_honest","re":true},"ev",{"VAR?":"bernie_influence"},2,"+",{"VAR=":"bernie_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Bernie Nwosu: Did she, now. Let's have a look.","\n",{"->":"the_struck_entry"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"bernie_influence"},1,"+",{"VAR=":"bernie_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Bernie Nwosu: You and four others tonight. Go on, then.","\n",{"->":"the_struck_entry"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"the_struck_entry":[["^Narrator: She turns the paper log round so you can both read it. Halfway down, in the small hours: EXTERNAL SECURITY CONSULTANT -- auth: DR S. KIM.","\n","^Narrator: A line has been ruled through it. Different biro. No initials.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: That's my log. And that's somebody else's crossing-out.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Nobody amends this book but me. That's the whole point of the book.","\n","ev","str","^Who's been behind this desk tonight?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Does it matter? You know I'm expected.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^Leave it exactly as it is. Don't tidy it up.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Me. Only me. I've not been to the loo since two.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Except when I walked the police out to the car park. Five minutes, maybe.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: ...Five minutes.","\n",{"->":"offer_key"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^Bernie Nwosu: It matters to me. Somebody's been at my book.","\n",{"->":"offer_key"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"bernie_influence"},2,"+",{"VAR=":"bernie_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Bernie Nwosu: You want me to preserve it.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: You're not really a consultant, are you.","\n","^Narrator: She lets the question sit, then visibly decides not to ask it again.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Right. It stays as it is.","\n",{"->":"offer_key"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"offer_key":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"gave_key","re":true},"#","^complete_task:sign_in_at_reception","/#","#","^unlock_aim:access_it_systems","/#","#","^set_global:bernie_gave_key:true","/#","#","^give_item:key:it_override_key","/#","^Narrator: She writes you into the log by hand, pressing hard.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: You're in the book. And no, I can't give you a badge that does anything.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: The readers are down, and the permissions system's behind that ransom screen with everything else.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: So Estates dumped every mechanical override on my hook and made it my problem.","\n","^Narrator: She unhooks a worn brass key and holds it a moment before she lets go.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: IT's off the handover room. Through Ward Three, along the link and up the main corridor. In the handover room, IT's the door on your right.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Gary's in there. He's not come out since half ten, so knock properly.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"was_honest"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"bernie_influence"},2,"+",{"VAR=":"bernie_influence","re":true},"/ev","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"bernie_trusts_player","re":true},"#","^influence_increased","/#","#","^set_global:bernie_trusts_player:true","/#","^Bernie Nwosu: And listen. You told me the truth when you could've fed me something easier. I've clocked that.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Anything goes sideways for you tonight, you come back to this desk. Yeah?","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.34"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"was_honest"},"!","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Sign it back in when you're done. I'll be here. I'm always here.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.41"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null],"returning":["^Bernie Nwosu: Back already. Go on, what's broken now?","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null],"cover_burned_entry":["^Narrator: Bernie is holding the handset away from her ear.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: *into the phone* No. I signed them in myself. With my own hand, in my own book.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Then whoever told you that is wrong, isn't -- hello?","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: That was security control. Somebody's rung them from an internal line to say there's no consultant booked tonight. Never was.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},{"#f":1}],"which_extension":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"asked_about_reeves_hours","re":true},"^Bernie Nwosu: Control wouldn't say. They never do.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: But there's four internal phones on this side of the building that aren't behind a locked door tonight. Three of them are on my desk.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: The fourth one's in the boardroom.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"observed_stranger"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Which is where your man in the plain suit's been stood all night, isn't it.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: ...I've said that out loud now. I can't unsay it.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.14"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null],"bernie_vouches":[["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"cover_restored","re":true},"#","^set_global:bernie_vouched:true","/#","#","^set_global:cover_restored:true","/#","^Narrator: She doesn't hesitate. She dials, and her voice goes flat and official, eleven years of front desk in it.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"bernie_influence"},3,"+",{"VAR=":"bernie_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Bernie Nwosu: Night reception, Nwosu. Logging a correction. The external consultant was booked at 01:02 on Dr Kim's authority and signed in by me personally.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: I'm naming myself as the vouching officer. Yes. Put it against my name. All of it.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: There. If you turn out to be something other than what you've told me, it's my job as well as yours. So don't.","\n","ev","str","^Understood. Thank you.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Why would you do that for me?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Go on. Before somebody rings them back.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},"#","^exit_conversation","/#",{"->":"hub"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Somebody's been at my book and on my phone. I don't like being made a liar in my own lobby.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: And you told me the truth this morning when you didn't have to. That's rarer than you'd think.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},"#","^exit_conversation","/#",{"->":"hub"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"bernie_hesitates":[["^Bernie Nwosu: I want to.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: But I've a supervisor telling me one thing and a phone call telling me another. Back the wrong one and I'm out of a job I've done eleven years.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: I signed you in. That's on the page. That's what I've got.","\n","ev","str","^That's fair. I'll find another way.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Eleven years, and you'd rather be right on paper than right.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"bernie_influence"},1,"+",{"VAR=":"bernie_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Bernie Nwosu: If it helps, the wards issue their own lanyards. Sister Doyle's got a drawer full for the agency staff.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: I didn't say that.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},"#","^exit_conversation","/#",{"->":"hub"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^Narrator: Her face closes.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"bernie_influence"},2,"-",{"VAR=":"bernie_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_decreased","/#","^Bernie Nwosu: Off you go.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},"#","^exit_conversation","/#",{"->":"hub"},null]}],null],"hub":[["ev",{"VAR?":"hub_quiet"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub.0.5"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"cover_burned"},{"VAR?":"cover_restored"},"!","&&",{"CNT?":"cover_burned_entry"},"!","&&",{"VAR?":"met_after_burn"},"!","&&","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"cover_burned_entry"},{"->":".^.^.^.14"},null]}],"nop","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: ",["ev","visit",3,"%","/ev","ev","du",0,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.s0","c":true},"ev","du",1,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.s1","c":true},"ev","du",2,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.s2","c":true},"nop",{"s0":["pop","^Back already. What's broken now?",{"->":".^.^.23"},null],"s1":["pop","^Go on, then.",{"->":".^.^.23"},null],"s2":["pop","^What do you need?",{"->":".^.^.23"},null],"#f":5}],"\n",{"->":"hub.0.5"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^Say that to security control. On the record, under your own name.","/str",{"VAR?":"cover_burned"},{"VAR?":"cover_restored"},"!","&&",{"VAR?":"bernie_trusts_player"},"&&","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":5},"ev","str","^You know I'm meant to be here. Back me up.","/str",{"VAR?":"cover_burned"},{"VAR?":"cover_restored"},"!","&&",{"VAR?":"bernie_trusts_player"},"!","&&","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":5},"ev","str","^That call came off an internal line. Which phones can reach control?","/str",{"VAR?":"cover_burned"},{"VAR?":"asked_about_reeves_hours"},"!","&&","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":5},"ev","str","^How bad is it upstairs, honestly?","/str",{"VAR?":"asked_situation"},"!","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":5},"ev","str","^Has anyone come through tonight who doesn't belong?","/str",{"VAR?":"observed_stranger"},"!","/ev",{"*":".^.c-4","flg":5},"ev","str","^This man in the plain suit. How long has he been around?","/str",{"VAR?":"observed_stranger"},{"VAR?":"asked_about_reeves_hours"},"!","&&","/ev",{"*":".^.c-5","flg":5},"ev","str","^Graham Reeves. Tell me everything you've noticed about him.","/str",{"VAR?":"insider_identified"},"/ev",{"*":".^.c-6","flg":5},"ev","str","^I should get moving.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-7","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"bernie_vouches"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"bernie_hesitates"},null],"c-2":["\n",{"->":"which_extension"},null],"c-3":["\n",{"->":"ask_situation"},null],"c-4":["\n",{"->":"observe_stranger"},null],"c-5":["\n",{"->":"reeves_hours"},null],"c-6":["\n",{"->":"reeves_confirmed"},null],"c-7":["\n","^Bernie Nwosu: ","ev",{"VAR?":"bernie_influence"},4,">=","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["^ Go on. And come back if you need me.",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["^Right you are.",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},"#","^exit_conversation","/#",{"->":"hub"},null]}],null],"ask_situation":[["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"asked_situation","re":true},"^Bernie Nwosu: Honestly? Nobody knows anything about anybody.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: We can't tell you what you're allergic to, or what you were given at eight, or whether your mum's been moved.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: A man came in at four looking for his wife. I walked him round three wards reading names off the ends of beds.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Forget the money. This place has forgotten everybody in it.","\n","ev","str","^How are you still standing?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Then let's give it its memory back.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"bernie_influence"},2,"+",{"VAR=":"bernie_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Bernie Nwosu: Vending machine's broken, so it's not the caffeine.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: You just keep going, don't you. Same as the girls upstairs.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"bernie_influence"},1,"+",{"VAR=":"bernie_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Bernie Nwosu: You say that like it's a thing a person can do.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null]}],null],"observe_stranger":[["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"observed_stranger","re":true},"^Bernie Nwosu: *lowering her voice* Now you mention it.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: There's a fella on night security. Plain suit, no uniform, no lanyard from us. Very polite. Very.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: He stands himself by the boardroom and the comms relay and doesn't move.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Everybody signs this book. Contractors, engineers, the lot. He never has. Says he's \"posted\", like that's an answer.","\n","ev","str","^What's his name?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Have you raised it with anyone?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},"ev","str","^Probably nothing. But thanks.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Couldn't tell you. He's never signed, so he's never had to say.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null],"c-1":["\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Val has. Val on security. She walks the main corridor outside the security office, and she's had him in her notebook for weeks.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Got told it was crisis protocol and to leave it. Twice.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null],"c-2":["\n","^Bernie Nwosu: That's what I keep telling myself.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null]}],null],"reeves_hours":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"asked_about_reeves_hours","re":true},"^Bernie Nwosu: Since the summer, he says.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Eleven years I've sat at this desk. Every face through those doors, twice a night.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: I'd never once clapped eyes on that man before this started.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null],"reeves_confirmed":[["^Bernie Nwosu: *very still* Reeves.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Six weeks ago there was a fire drill. Half two in the morning, nothing on the board. Estates were livid. They hadn't scheduled it.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: He walked two men in high-vis through this lobby and said they were with facilities. I asked for names for the book.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: He said, \"That's alright, Bernie, I'll sign for them.\" And I let him.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: He was security, I was on my own, and it was half two in the morning.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: ...I let him.","\n","ev","str","^That's on him. His whole job was to be believed.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Write it down, exactly as you just said it, and sign it.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"bernie_influence"},2,"+",{"VAR=":"bernie_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Bernie Nwosu: Yeah. Well.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: Go and make it cost him.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},"#","^exit_conversation","/#",{"->":"hub"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^Narrator: She's already reaching for a fresh sheet.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"bernie_influence"},2,"+",{"VAR=":"bernie_influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Bernie Nwosu: Every word.","\n","^Bernie Nwosu: If somebody's going to ask questions about tonight, they can have mine in writing.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},"#","^exit_conversation","/#",{"->":"hub"},null]}],null],"global decl":["ev",0,{"VAR=":"bernie_influence"},false,{"VAR=":"asked_situation"},false,{"VAR=":"observed_stranger"},false,{"VAR=":"asked_about_reeves_hours"},false,{"VAR=":"gave_key"},false,{"VAR=":"was_honest"},false,{"VAR=":"hub_quiet"},false,{"VAR=":"met_after_burn"},false,{"VAR=":"cover_burned"},false,{"VAR=":"cover_restored"},false,{"VAR=":"bernie_trusts_player"},false,{"VAR=":"noticed_struck_booking"},false,{"VAR=":"insider_identified"},"/ev","end",null]}],"listDefs":{}}
