-{"inkVersion":21,"root":[[["done",{"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"start":["ev",{"VAR?":"access_explained"},{"CNT?":"first_meeting"},"||","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"returning"},{"->":"start.6"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"first_meeting"},null],"first_meeting":[["#","^complete_task:meet_dr_kim","/#","#","^unlock_aim:access_it_systems","/#","^Narrator: Dr. Sarah Kim stands at the window with a mobile in each hand. She has been up since three, and good tailoring can't hide it.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: You're the consultant.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Three things, quickly. I'm waiting on a board call that's been rescheduled twice and will land the moment I stop expecting it.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Forty-seven patients on generators. Twelve hours of fuel. And the board votes on paying these people in four.","\n","ev","str","^Then let's not waste any of it. Tell me how they got in.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^You called us in. That took nerve, given what the vote's going to cost you.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^Four things. You've missed one. What do you actually need from me?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","#","^influence_increased","/#",{"->":"explain_attack"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Nerve. That's a generous word for it.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: I'd already decided who was to blame. I wanted somebody in the building who wasn't me.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"kim_guilt_revealed","re":true},{"->":"explain_attack"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Dr. Sarah Kim: ...Yes. All right.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: I need an alternative. Any alternative. I cannot walk into that room with nothing but a Bitcoin address.","\n",{"->":"explain_attack"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"explain_attack":[["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"topic_attack_vector","re":true},"^Dr. Sarah Kim: The backup server. A flaw in its file transfer software. Old, public, patchable for years.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: I won't pretend I understand the detail. That's Gary Whitlock's world, and he's been trying to explain it to me since May.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: What I understood was the figure next to it. Eighty-five thousand pounds.","\n","ev","str","^And you deferred it.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^What did you spend it on instead?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^Understood. Where's Gary now?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"kim_guilt_revealed","re":true},"^Dr. Sarah Kim: I deferred it. Yes. Say the next bit as well. You've clearly got it ready.","\n",{"->":"the_deferral"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"kim_guilt_revealed","re":true},"^Dr. Sarah Kim: You know the answer, or you wouldn't ask.","\n",{"->":"the_deferral"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"topic_gary","re":true},{"->":"discuss_gary"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"the_deferral":[["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"kim_guilt_revealed","re":true},"^Dr. Sarah Kim: A replacement scanner. Three point two million.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: And yes, I can defend it. I did, to a commissioning board, with a slide deck. Imaging capacity against infrastructure that had never once failed.","\n","^Narrator: She looks at the dead screen on her desk.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: \"Never once failed.\" That was the actual sentence. I said it out loud in March.","\n","ev","str","^You made a clinical trade-off with the information you had. That's the job.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^You had a written warning from your own administrator. Seven of them.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^Save it for the inquiry. Right now I need doors.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Dr. Sarah Kim: I had the information. That's the difficulty. It was in my inbox seven times.","\n",{"->":"access_problem"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","#","^influence_decreased","/#","^Dr. Sarah Kim: I know exactly how many. I replied to all of them.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Better you say it to me than a coroner. Get on with your job.","\n",{"->":"access_problem"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Dr. Sarah Kim: *almost relieved* Thank you. Yes. Doors.","\n",{"->":"access_problem"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"access_problem":[["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"access_explained","re":true},"#","^give_item:id_badge","/#","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Now I disappoint you, and I'll be precise, because everyone I've told tonight assumes I'm being obstructive.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: I am the Chief Technology Officer of this hospital, and I cannot grant you access to a single room in it.","\n","ev","str","^Because?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Your badge system is encrypted along with everything else.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"access_because"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Thank you. Yes. Somebody listens.","\n",{"->":"access_because"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"access_because":[["^Dr. Sarah Kim: Access control runs on the same estate as everything else. Every permission, every card, every door group, behind that ransom screen.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: I can authorise you until I lose my voice. It won't open one door.","\n","^Narrator: She signs your paper badge, writes an extension on it, and hands it back.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: That's the extent of my power tonight. A signature on a piece of card.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: The mechanical override keys are on a hook at reception, back down through the ward. Bernie has them, and more authority than her job title suggests. Be nice to her.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: The server room I can't help with at all. Its reader is isolated and only takes a card that already exists.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Gary has one. I don't.","\n","ev","str","^So my route is Gary.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Then what have you actually got?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Your route is Gary.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Through the handover room, the door on the east side, behind the override lock.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: He's been in there since half past ten, and I haven't had the courage to knock.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null],"c-1":["\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: A boardroom, a telephone and four hours.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null]}],null],"hub":[["ev",{"VAR?":"hub_quiet"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub.0.5"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: ","ev",{"VAR?":"cover_burned"},{"VAR?":"cover_restored"},"!","&&",{"CNT?":"cover_reaction"},"!","&&","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["^ I've heard. Security control rang the switchboard about you.",{"->":".^.^.^.13"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["ev",{"VAR?":"offline_keys_recovered"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["^ Tell me you have something I can take into that room.",{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":[["ev","visit",3,"%","/ev","ev","du",0,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.s0","c":true},"ev","du",1,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.s1","c":true},"ev","du",2,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.s2","c":true},"nop",{"s0":["pop","^Progress?",{"->":".^.^.23"},null],"s1":["pop","^Yes?",{"->":".^.^.23"},null],"s2":["pop","^What do you need?",{"->":".^.^.23"},null],"#f":5}],{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],"nop",{"->":".^.^.^.13"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"hub.0.5"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^Someone in here helped ENTROPY in. You cut the budget. Was it you?","/str",{"VAR?":"insider_evidence_partial"},{"VAR?":"insider_identified"},"!","&&",{"CNT?":"accuse_kim"},"!","&&","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":5},"ev","str","^Someone's rung security and told them I was never booked.","/str",{"VAR?":"cover_burned"},{"VAR?":"cover_restored"},"!","&&",{"CNT?":"cover_reaction"},"!","&&","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":5},"ev","str","^Your board chair has already written to Legal about Gary. Did you know?","/str",{"VAR?":"board_coverup_email_found"},{"VAR?":"player_warned_kim"},"!","&&","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":5},"ev","str","^Gary doesn't carry this alone. I want that on the record.","/str",{"VAR?":"topic_gary"},{"VAR?":"player_warned_kim"},"!","&&","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":5},"ev","str","^There's an offline key escrow in the emergency store. What's on that safe?","/str",{"VAR?":"escrow_safe_known"},{"VAR?":"topic_escrow"},"!","&&",{"VAR?":"offline_keys_recovered"},"!","&&","/ev",{"*":".^.c-4","flg":5},"ev","str","^Is anything in this building still offline? Anything they couldn't reach?","/str",{"VAR?":"escrow_safe_known"},"!",{"VAR?":"topic_escrow"},"!","&&",{"VAR?":"offline_keys_recovered"},"!","&&","/ev",{"*":".^.c-5","flg":5},"ev","str","^You asked what to tell the board. I'll answer properly now.","/str",{"VAR?":"topic_ransom_vote"},{"VAR?":"advised_on_vote"},"!","&&","/ev",{"*":".^.c-6","flg":5},"ev","str","^Talk me through this board vote.","/str",{"VAR?":"topic_ransom_vote"},"!","/ev",{"*":".^.c-7","flg":5},"ev","str","^Anything odd on nights lately? Drills, alarms?","/str",{"VAR?":"topic_fire_drill"},"!","/ev",{"*":".^.c-8","flg":5},"ev","str","^Tell me about Gary Whitlock.","/str",{"VAR?":"topic_gary"},"!","/ev",{"*":".^.c-9","flg":5},"ev","str","^I need to get into IT. What can you actually authorise?","/str",{"VAR?":"access_explained"},"!",{"VAR?":"it_door_open"},"!","&&","/ev",{"*":".^.c-10","flg":5},"ev","str","ev",{"CNT?":"boardroom_code"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["^ The boardroom code again?",{"->":"hub.0.132"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["^What's the code for the boardroom?",{"->":"hub.0.132"},null]}],"nop","/str",{"VAR?":"found_boardroom_code"},"!","/ev",{"*":".^.c-11","flg":5},"ev","str","^I need to get on.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-12","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"accuse_kim"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"cover_reaction"},null],"c-2":["\n",{"->":"board_coverup"},null],"c-3":["\n",{"->":"protect_gary"},null],"c-4":["\n",{"->":"escrow_safe"},null],"c-5":["\n",{"->":"escrow_lead_in"},null],"c-6":["\n",{"->":"ransom_decision_input"},null],"c-7":["\n",{"->":"explain_board_vote"},null],"c-8":["\n",{"->":"fire_drill"},null],"c-9":["\n",{"->":"discuss_gary"},null],"c-10":["\n",{"->":"access_problem"},null],"c-11":["\n",{"->":"boardroom_code"},null],"c-12":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"offline_keys_recovered"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Then go. If you find me an alternative before they dial in, I'll use it.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Yes. Go.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],"nop","\n","#","^exit_conversation","/#","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null]}],null],"discuss_gary":[["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"topic_gary","re":true},"^Dr. Sarah Kim: Gary is the best administrator this hospital has, and I've spent six months teaching him that being right is worthless here.","\n","#","^unlock_task:learn_about_scapegoating","/#","^Dr. Sarah Kim: He's going to be sacked. I don't think I get to make that decision any more. The paperwork will say \"implementation failure\".","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: And what will finish me, when I'm old, is that he'll believe it was my idea.","\n","ev","str","^Was it?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Then go and tell him. It costs you nothing.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: No.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: But I deferred his budget, told him to stop escalating, and haven't been through that door once tonight. At some point the difference stops mattering.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null],"c-1":["\n","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Dr. Sarah Kim: When the wards are back.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: If I go in now, I'm asking him to forgive me while his patients are on generators. That's management, dressed as an apology.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null]}],null],"protect_gary":[["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"player_warned_kim","re":true},"#","^influence_increased","/#","#","^complete_task:learn_about_scapegoating","/#","#","^set_global:gary_protected:true","/#","ev",{"VAR?":"kim_statement_given"},"!","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"kim_statement_given","re":true},"#","^give_item:notes:kim_statement","/#",{"->":".^.^.^.18"},null]}],"nop","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: You want it in writing.","\n","^Narrator: She doesn't argue. She writes for thirty seconds, signs it, and holds it out without reading it back.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Statement of fact. The remediation was costed, escalated seven times, and deferred on my recommendation.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: If they want a name on this, they can have the correct one.","\n","ev","str","^This will end your career.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^I'll make sure it reaches the right people.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Probably. It was going to anyway. This way it ends accurately.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null],"c-1":["\n","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Do.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null]}],null],"board_coverup":[["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"player_warned_kim","re":true},"#","^complete_task:learn_about_scapegoating","/#","#","^set_global:gary_protected:true","/#","ev",{"VAR?":"kim_statement_given"},"!","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"kim_statement_given","re":true},"#","^give_item:notes:kim_statement","/#",{"->":".^.^.^.15"},null]}],"nop","\n","^Narrator: You describe the email. Board chair to Legal: implementation failure, termination papers, a non-disparagement agreement.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Non-disparagement.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: So they've decided it was him, and that he isn't to be allowed to say otherwise.","\n","^Narrator: She sets both phones down.","\n","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Whatever happens on this vote, that doesn't.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: You have my statement and his emails. If it comes to it, you have me in a committee room saying it out loud.","\n","ev","str","^Good. Hold that when the room gets warm.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: I've held the wrong thing since March. I can manage one night of holding the right one.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null]}],null],"fire_drill":[["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"topic_fire_drill","re":true},"^Dr. Sarah Kim: Six weeks ago.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: There was a drill. Half past two, no notice. I was rung at home about it, and Estates spent the next week furious.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Nobody had scheduled it. It isn't on the annual plan, and there's no record of anyone requesting it.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: We put it down to a fault on the panel and moved on. We had a scanner to install.","\n","ev","str","^Somebody walked contractors in that night, under cover of a drill nobody called.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Noted. I'll come back to it.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"insider_evidence_partial","re":true},"#","^influence_increased","/#","#","^set_global:insider_evidence_partial:true","/#","^Dr. Sarah Kim: *slowly* And I signed it off as a panel fault.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Find out who. Please.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Do.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"escrow_lead_in":["^Dr. Sarah Kim: One thing. The offline key escrow. It's in a safe in the emergency equipment store, and the safe is the problem.","\n",{"->":"escrow_safe"},null],"escrow_safe":[["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"topic_escrow","re":true},"#","^set_global:found_safe_pin_clue:true","/#","^Dr. Sarah Kim: A four-digit keypad.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Estates put it on the audit snag list. Three times. Item nineteen. I could give you the reference for most things by now.","\n","ev","str","^What's the code?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Three times, and it's still on the default.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: The year we were founded. It's on the brass plaque in the lobby, at chest height.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Nobody ever quite got to item nineteen. Including me. Especially me.","\n",{"->":"escrow_safe_out"},null],"c-1":["\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Yes.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: It's the founding year, on the plaque in the lobby. I'm saying it quickly because it doesn't sound better slowly.","\n",{"->":"escrow_safe_out"},null]}],null],"escrow_safe_out":["^Dr. Sarah Kim: If those keys are still in there, they're the only thing in this building ENTROPY hasn't got a copy of.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null],"boardroom_code":["ev",{"CNT?":".^"},1,">","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Nought-four-one-seven.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"topic_ransom_vote"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Nought-four-one-seven.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: It's been the same since I arrived, and it's written in my desk diary. That tells you a lot about us.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.13"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Nought-four-one-seven.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Ah. The board papers are in there, and you want to know what they knew. Go on. There's nothing in that room I'm proud of.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.13"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},{"#f":1}],"explain_board_vote":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"topic_ransom_vote","re":true},"^Dr. Sarah Kim: A hundred and fifty thousand pounds. Against forty-seven people on generators and a hospital that cannot tell you what anyone is allergic to.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Six of the nine will vote to pay. Frightened people, told a number and a timescale by somebody very good at presenting both.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: And in the narrow sense they're right. Paying is faster. Faster is fewer funerals tonight.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: It also hands the money to the people who did this, so they can do it to somebody else in a month.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: They dial in the moment they've finished arguing. What do I tell them?","\n",{"->":"ransom_decision_input"},null],"ransom_decision_input":[["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"advised_on_vote","re":true},"^Dr. Sarah Kim: Careful. I'll say it on that call as though I thought of it myself, and I won't name you if it goes badly.","\n","ev","str","^Pay. Whatever it costs later, the people on those generators are yours tonight.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Don't pay. Give me the time and I'll bring you the keys myself.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},"ev","str","^It isn't my decision. Buy me time and I'll change the options.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","#","^set_global:advised_board_pay:true","/#","#","^set_global:advised_board_refuse:false","/#","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Then that's what I'll argue.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: And if anyone asks who advised it, my name goes on it. Not yours.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null],"c-1":["\n","#","^set_global:advised_board_refuse:true","/#","#","^set_global:advised_board_pay:false","/#","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Dr. Sarah Kim: You're asking me to stake forty-seven lives on you being quick.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: ...All right. I'll hold them off as long as I can.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Do not make me a liar in that room, Agent.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null],"c-2":["\n","#","^set_global:advised_board_refuse:false","/#","#","^set_global:advised_board_pay:false","/#","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Everyone in this building has had an opinion tonight.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: You're the first to say the decision isn't theirs to make. Time I can buy. Go.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null]}],null],"cover_reaction":[["^Dr. Sarah Kim: *sharply* Rung security from where?","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: I countersigned your badge an hour ago. I haven't spoken to security control all night.","\n","^Narrator: She reaches for a phone, stops, and puts it down again.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: And I can't fix it. There's no system left to correct the record in. That's exactly why it worked.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Somebody in this building understood that before you did, and before I did.","\n","ev","str","^Then they know what's on that backup server.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Take the call when it comes. I'll handle the rest of it.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Then get to it before they do anything else clever.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Yes. Find something for me to hold up in there.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null]}],{"#f":1}],"accuse_kim":[["^Dr. Sarah Kim: *very still* I rang SAFETYNET at one this morning. I brought you into this building. I signed your badge.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: If I were working with these people, I'd be the least competent traitor in the history of the profession.","\n","ev","str","^You're right. That doesn't add up. I'm sorry.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Guilt is a very good cover. So is calling us in.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","#","^influence_decreased","/#","^Dr. Sarah Kim: I made a catastrophic decision in March. Inviting them in wasn't part of it.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Now stop spending time we don't have, and go and find who did.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"accuse_kim_push"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"accuse_kim_push":["^Dr. Sarah Kim: How dare you.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: People are dying on backup power because of a decision I made, and you're building a theory out of my remorse.","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: We are finished. Find your own way round my hospital.","\n","#","^hostile:dr_sarah_kim","/#","#","^set_global:accused_wrong_suspect:true","/#","#","^exit_conversation","/#","done",null],"returning":["ev",{"VAR?":"cover_burned"},{"VAR?":"cover_restored"},"!","&&","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: I've heard. Security control rang the switchboard about you.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},{"->":".^.^.^.7"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"offline_keys_recovered"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Tell me you have something I can take into that room.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},{"->":".^.^.^.13"},null]}],"nop","\n","^Dr. Sarah Kim: Progress?","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null],"global decl":["ev",false,{"VAR=":"kim_guilt_revealed"},false,{"VAR=":"topic_attack_vector"},false,{"VAR=":"topic_gary"},false,{"VAR=":"topic_ransom_vote"},false,{"VAR=":"topic_fire_drill"},false,{"VAR=":"topic_escrow"},false,{"VAR=":"player_warned_kim"},false,{"VAR=":"access_explained"},false,{"VAR=":"advised_on_vote"},false,{"VAR=":"kim_statement_given"},false,{"VAR=":"hub_quiet"},false,{"VAR=":"insider_evidence_partial"},false,{"VAR=":"insider_identified"},false,{"VAR=":"cover_burned"},false,{"VAR=":"cover_restored"},false,{"VAR=":"board_coverup_email_found"},false,{"VAR=":"offline_keys_recovered"},false,{"VAR=":"escrow_safe_known"},false,{"VAR=":"it_door_open"},false,{"VAR=":"found_boardroom_code"},"/