re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Val Okonkwo: I know how many there are. I walked past every one of them on my first round.","\n","^Val Okonkwo: Doesn't tell me who you are, though, does it.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"warned_player","re":true},"#","^set_global:val_met:true","/#","ev",{"VAR?":"influence"},20,"-",{"VAR=":"influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_decreased","/#","^Val Okonkwo: *the smile goes* Right.","\n","^Val Okonkwo: Then we've got a problem. \"I'd rather not get into it\" is a full sentence, and it means no.","\n",{"->":"standoff"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"claim_consultant":["ev",{"VAR?":"dr_kim_met"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Val Okonkwo: Right, yeah. Reception flagged it through about an hour back.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Val Okonkwo: Consultant. Right.","\n","^Val Okonkwo: Nobody's told me, but nobody's told me anything since two forty-seven. Join the queue.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"bernie_gave_key"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Val Okonkwo: Bernie's signed you in, has she? Then go and have a word with Dr Kim.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.10"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Val Okonkwo: Get yourself signed in properly at reception and have a word with Dr Kim.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.10"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],"nop","\n","^Val Okonkwo: Server room's through my office, and it's card-only. One card left in the building opens it: Gary's, in IT.","\n","^Val Okonkwo: Come back with it and I'll open the office for you.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null],"cover_challenge":["ev",{"VAR?":"warned_player"},{"VAR?":"val_met"},"||",{"VAR?":"val_caught_picking"},"||","!","/ev",{"VAR=":"challenge_is_first_meeting","re":true},"ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"warned_player","re":true},"ev",{"VAR?":"val_challenged"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Val Okonkwo: Back again. Have you got something for me this time?","\n",{"->":"cover_challenge_options"},{"->":".^.^.^.17"},null]}],"nop","\n","^Narrator: She isn't ambling any more. She closes the distance before you've decided what to do with it, and plants herself between you and her office door.","\n","^Val Okonkwo: Stay where you are.","\n",{"->":"cover_challenge_speech"},null],"cover_challenge_speech":["ev",{"VAR?":"val_challenged"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Val Okonkwo: Same question as before, and I'm still waiting on an answer.","\n",{"->":"cover_challenge_options"},{"->":".^.^.^.4"},null]}],"nop","\n","#","^set_global:val_challenged:true","/#","^Val Okonkwo: Control have just been on. There's no external consultant booked at this hospital tonight. There never was.","\n","^Val Okonkwo: Reception's paper log's been amended, and there's nothing on the system, because there is no system.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"challenge_is_first_meeting"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Val Okonkwo: So. Whoever you are, start talking.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.18"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Val Okonkwo: So whatever you told me an hour ago, start again.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.18"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"cover_challenge_options"},null],"cover_challenge_options":[["ev","str","^Show her the lanyard.","/str",{"VAR?":"staff_lanyard_obtained"},"/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":5},"ev","str","^Ring Bernie on reception. She's logged a correction under her own name.","/str",{"VAR?":"bernie_vouched"},"/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":5},"ev","str","^Ring Bernie on reception. She signed me in. She'll vouch for me.","/str",{"VAR?":"bernie_trusts_player"},{"VAR?":"bernie_vouched"},"!","&&","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":5},"ev","str","^Val, you've watched me for an hour. Do I look like the problem tonight?","/str",{"VAR?":"influence"},20,">=","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":5},"ev","str","^Somebody phoned that in to keep me out of that room. Who benefits?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-4","flg":4},"ev","str","^Then we're doing this the hard way. (Fight her.)","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-5","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"show_lanyard"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"bernie_backs_you"},null],"c-2":["\n",{"->":"bernie_backs_you"},null],"c-3":["\n",{"->":"earn_it"},null],"c-4":["\n",{"->":"the_argument"},null],"c-5":["^ ","#","^color:red","/#","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"influence"},40,"-",{"VAR=":"influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_decreased","/#","^Val Okonkwo: *hand going to her radio* Don't.","\n","^Val Okonkwo: Don't you dare. Not in here, not tonight--","\n","#","^hostile:security_guard_patrol","/#","#","^set_global:attacked_guard:true","/#","#","^exit_conversation","/#","done",null]}],null],"show_lanyard":[["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"cleared_after_burn","re":true},"ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"cover_restored","re":true},"#","^set_global:cover_restored:true","/#","^Narrator: She turns the lanyard over, checks the back, and hands it back.","\n","^Val Okonkwo: Hospital pass. Blank, no photo. Could have come out of anybody's drawer.","\n","^Narrator: She looks at you for a long moment. Somewhere behind you a generator changes note. ","#","^lighting_dip","/#","\n","^Val Okonkwo: Here's where I've got to. Either you're a wrong 'un with a stolen pass, or somebody's had my control room told a lie about you.","\n","^Val Okonkwo: And this building's been lying to me about who's supposed to be stood where for six weeks now. So.","\n","^Val Okonkwo: Go on. But you come past me on the way out and tell me what you found, or I'll take it very personally.","\n",{"->t->":"val_opens_office"},"ev","str","^Deal.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Six weeks. Tell me about that.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"influence"},10,"+",{"VAR=":"influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Val Okonkwo: Right.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},"#","^exit_conversation","/#",{"->":"hub"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"discu