wards the fire.","\n","^Val Okonkwo: I've stood in a lot of corridors. That counts for something.","\n","^Val Okonkwo: And the fella I reckon rang that in has never once stopped when I've asked.","\n","^Val Okonkwo: I'm putting my own name against this in my notebook. If you make a fool of me I'll find you myself.","\n",{"->t->":"val_opens_office"},"ev","str","^Understood.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Who is he? The one who doesn't stop.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"influence"},5,"+",{"VAR=":"influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Val Okonkwo: Go on, then.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},"#","^exit_conversation","/#",{"->":"hub"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"discuss_reeves"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"val_opens_office":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"val_opened_office","re":true},"#","^unlock_door:security_office","/#","#","^set_global:val_opened_office:true","/#","^Narrator: She unlocks the office door and stands aside.","\n","ev","void","/ev","->->",null],"the_argument":[["ev",{"VAR?":"val_argument_heard"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Val Okonkwo: We've done this. A pass, a name on a log, or somebody on a phone. Not a theory.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Val Okonkwo: Everyone who's ever been where they shouldn't has a theory about who grassed them up.","\n","^Val Okonkwo: Give me something I can hold. A pass. A name on a log. Somebody on a phone saying you're alright.","\n","^Val Okonkwo: \"Who benefits?\" is what people say when they've got none of those.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^Fine. Here.","/str",{"VAR?":"staff_lanyard_obtained"},"/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":5},"ev","str","^Then ring Bernie. She's already logged it.","/str",{"VAR?":"bernie_vouched"},"/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":5},"ev","str","^Then ring Bernie. She'll put her name to me.","/str",{"VAR?":"bernie_trusts_player"},{"VAR?":"bernie_vouched"},"!