+{"inkVersion":21,"root":[[["done",{"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"start":["ev",{"VAR?":"cover_burned"},{"VAR?":"cover_restored"},"!","&&",{"VAR?":"gave_lanyard"},"!","&&",{"VAR?":"spoke_about_patients"},"&&","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"burned_entry"},{"->":"start.12"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"spoke_about_patients"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"returning"},{"->":"start.18"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"first_meeting"},null],"first_meeting":[["^Narrator: Six beds. A nurse working the far end with a clipboard, and Sister Doyle planted at bed two, eyes on the machine that is breathing for a woman.","\n","^Sister Doyle: Are you meant to be on my ward? ","#","^delivery: without looking round","/#","\n","^Sister Doyle: I've had four people through here tonight who weren't, and every one of them wanted to tell me about the computers.","\n","ev","str","^Security consultant. I'm here to get your monitoring back.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^What am I looking at? Talk me through the ward.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^No. Tell me to go and I'll go.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^Sister Doyle: Right. The computers.","\n",{"->":"stakes"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^Narrator: Sister Doyle looks round for the first time.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"showed_empathy","re":true},"ev",{"VAR?":"influence"},2,"+",{"VAR=":"influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Sister Doyle: Two minutes. And I'm not leaving this bed while I do it.","\n",{"->":"ward_tour"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"influence"},2,"+",{"VAR=":"influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Sister Doyle: ...No. Stay.","\n","^Sister Doyle: You're the first one tonight who's asked instead of announcing.","\n",{"->":"stakes"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"ward_tour":[["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"spoke_about_patients","re":true},"#","^complete_task:talk_to_ward_nurse","/#","^Narrator: She nods down the row as she talks. She doesn't lower her voice. These are her patients, and they can hear.","\n","^Sister Doyle: Bed four. Mr Pryce, sixty-seven, ventilated. The machine has its own power. It's the monitoring that's gone dark.","\n","^Sister Doyle: Bed two. Mrs Hargreaves, on ECMO. That's her heart and her lungs, both, in a box beside the bed.","\n","^Sister Doyle: If that alarms and nobody's stood next to it, she has about four minutes.","\n","^Sister Doyle: Bed five's Ms Chen. Seventy-one, post-op, and she's been doing my obs for me with her eyes.","\n","^Sister Doyle: Six beds in this bay. Two more bays down the corridor. Forty-seven altogether.","\n","ev","str","^Four minutes. And no alarm.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^What are you most frightened of?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^Understood. I'll be quick.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"showed_empathy","re":true},"ev",{"VAR?":"influence"},2,"+",{"VAR=":"influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Sister Doyle: So I stand here. That's the whole plan. I watch this bed with my own eyes, and Priya runs everybody else on paper.","\n","^Sister Doyle: Twenty years of training, and tonight I'm an alarm.","\n",{"->":"hub_intro"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"showed_empathy","re":true},"ev",{"VAR?":"influence"},3,"+",{"VAR=":"influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#",{"->":"the_fear"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","^Sister Doyle: Aye. Do.","\n",{"->":"hub_intro"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"the_fear":[["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"showed_empathy","re":true},"^Sister Doyle: The small thing. Always the small one.","\n","^Sister Doyle: A drift across three readings. The screen would have flagged it orange at ten past. I'll see it at half past, when I get back round.","\n","^Sister Doyle: Twenty minutes. That's the whole difference between the machine watching and me watching.","\n","^Sister Doyle: I've been good at this for twenty years. I'm not good enough to be six machines.","\n","ev","str","^Then let's give you your machines back.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Nobody could be. Nobody should have to be.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"influence"},2,"+",{"VAR=":"influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Sister Doyle: Go on, then. ","#","^delivery: distracted, eyes already back on bed two","/#","\n",{"->":"hub_intro"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"influence"},3,"+",{"VAR=":"influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Sister Doyle: Tell me that at half past, when I'm the one holding the chart.","\n",{"->":"hub_intro"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"stakes":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"spoke_about_patients","re":true},"#","^complete_task:talk_to_ward_nurse","/#","^Sister Doyle: Forty-seven across three wards. Ventilators, ECMO, dialysis, all fed into a monitoring system that died at ten to three.","\n","^Sister Doyle: The machines still run. Nobody's watching them.","\n","^Sister Doyle: Two of us, manual obs every fifteen minutes, and a biro.","\n",{"->":"hub_intro"},null],"hub_intro":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null],"hub":[["ev",{"VAR?":"hub_quiet"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub.0.5"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"cover_burned"},{"VAR?":"cover_restored"},"!","&&",{"VAR?":"gave_lanyard"},"!","&&",{"CNT?":"burned_entry"},"!","&&","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"burned_entry"},{"->":".^.^.^.14"},null]}],"nop","\n","^Sister Doyle: ","ev",{"VAR?":"offline_keys_recovered"},{"CNT?":"good_news"},"!","&&","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["^ Tell me you've something.",{"->":".^.^.^.25"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":[["ev","visit",3,"%","/ev","ev","du",0,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.s0","c":true},"ev","du",1,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.s1","c":true},"ev","du",2,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.s2","c":true},"nop",{"s0":["pop","^Still here, then.",{"->":".^.^.23"},null],"s1":["pop","^What is it?",{"->":".^.^.23"},null],"s2":["pop","^Quick, then.",{"->":".^.^.23"},null],"#f":5}],{"->":".^.^.^.25"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"hub.0.5"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^How are you managing without the systems?","/str",{"VAR?":"spoke_about_manual"},"!","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":5},"ev","str","^How long can you keep this up?","/str",{"VAR?":"spoke_about_timeline"},"!","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":5},"ev","str","^Security think I was never booked in. I need a way back up that corridor.","/str",{"VAR?":"cover_burned"},{"VAR?":"cover_restored"},"!","&&",{"VAR?":"gave_lanyard"},"!","&&","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":5},"ev","str","^I've got the offline keys. Your monitors are coming back.","/str",{"VAR?":"offline_keys_recovered"},"/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":5},"ev","str","^I'll let you work.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-4","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"manual_work"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"timeline"},null],"c-2":["\n",{"->":"the_lanyard"},null],"c-3":["\n",{"->":"good_news"},null],"c-4":["\n","^Sister Doyle: ","ev",{"VAR?":"influence"},4,">=","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["^ Go on. And thank you for looking at them properly.",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["^Aye.",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},"#","^exit_conversation","/#",{"->":"hub"},null]}],null],"manual_work":[["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"spoke_about_manual","re":true},"^Sister Doyle: Obs every fifteen minutes. Cuff, probe, thermometer, biro.","\n","^Sister Doyle: Drug rounds off a paper chart we printed at two, before the printers went as well.","\n","^Sister Doyle: If a doctor changes a dose tonight, it changes on my bit of paper and nowhere else. God help whoever's on at seven.","\n","^Sister Doyle: We're managing. And managing is what you do instead of the actual standard.","\n","ev","str","^You shouldn't have to be doing this at all.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Understood. Every hour I save you is a real hour.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"influence"},2,"+",{"VAR=":"influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Sister Doyle: No. But there's a woman in bed two, so.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"influence"},1,"+",{"VAR=":"influence","re":true},"/ev","#","^influence_increased","/#","^Sister Doyle: It is. Go and save me some.","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"hub_quiet","re":true},{"->":"hub"},null]}],null],"timeline":[["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"spoke_about_timeline","re":true},"^Sister Doyle: Generators are good for twelve hours from lockdown. We're four in.","\n","^Sister Doyle: Eight hours, then. And the last two will be very bad ones, whatever anybody decides in a boardroom.","\n","^Sister Doyle: The registrar worked out a risk per hour. Came and told me it at half two, like it was helpful.","\n","^Sister Doyle: I asked him not to say it again on my ward.","\n","^Sister Doyle: If it's the emergency kit you're after: far end of this ward, through the door at the back. Backup gear's in there.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"showed_empathy"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","#","^complete_task:gather_pin_clues","/#","^Sister Doyle: There's a PIN safe on it. The override's the year this place was founded. It's on the plaque in the lobby.","\n","^Sister Doyle: Twenty years and nobody's changed it. If knowing that gets those monitors back a minute sooner, I don't care who I'm not supposed to tell.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.19"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Sister Doyle: There's a PIN safe on it. Old institutional code. It's written up in half a dozen places in this building, if you stop and look.","\n","^Sister Doyle: I haven't the time to walk you round it. I've patients to watch.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.19"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^I'll be as fast as I can.","/s